Subject: [PATCH 1/8] docs(process): agent roles trial - coordinator, Opus and
 Sonnet workers, Haiku context scouts

Adds the coordinator and context-scout agents. Sets the max, high and
medium issue workers to Opus and the low worker to Sonnet. The work-issue
skill sends a worker to a scout for its context. AGENTS.md states the
roles as a trial.

Refs #2464

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>
